From 2b909a365f9128eb860667a01e4af59d3451d0ff Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Timo <1788603+darknagel@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 19:02:43 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] temp/libcamera: add Samsung S5K3M5 sensor support

Add the camera sensor helper and sensor properties for the Samsung
S5K3M5 (telephoto camera of the OnePlus 8 Pro) and a tuning file for the
software ISP with the black level of 64 at 10 bits measured on the
sensor. Without the helper the AGC can only change the exposure time and
the image stays far too dark.

Signed-off-by: Timo <1788603+darknagel@users.noreply.github.com>
---
