 temp/libcamera/s5k3m5.yaml                    | 11 +++
 3 files changed, 91 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)
 create mode 100644 temp/libcamera/0007-libcamera-camera_sensor-Add-Samsung-S5K3M5-sensor-pr.patch
